  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of online course Open Data in Agriculture and farmers data management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present project will be funding the creation of Massive Open Online Course (MOOC) entitled: Open Data in Agriculture and farmers data management, which will include case studies and examples and will deliver two courses during 2019. This course aims at providing organizations working in development programmes with the necessary methodologies, tools and skills to plan and implement an experience capitalization process and contribute to increased efficiency and effectiveness of their work.</narrative>
  </description>
